      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 1998.2,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684561670,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1825831334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 传统持续学习评测局限于静态分类标签，传统 Agent 基准（AgentBench 等）则把每个任务拆成孤立短回合，无法检验跨周/跨月的状态延续与经验积累；\n2. 现有大模型高度依赖用户显式指令，缺乏「无外部提示时根据时间/状态变化主动规划并执行」的自驱能力。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 传统持续学习评测局限于静态分类标签，传统 Agent 基准（AgentBench 等）则把每个任务拆成孤立短回合，无法检验跨周/跨月的状态延续与经验积累；\n2. 现有大模型高度依赖用户显式指令，缺乏「无外部提示时根据时间/状态变化主动规划并执行」的自驱能力。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
